{"overview":"Oscar Krug is looked upon with suspicion by his neighbors because of his German name. When the US is drawn into the war with Germany, he enlists and travels the seas with his wife, Alice Morse. During a submarine attack Alice is snatched from Krug's side by a German officer. Krug now lives to have his revenge, and when the opportunity presents itself, he will have it.","tagline":"Vengeance! Deep as the Ocean!","cast":[{"n":"Hobart Bosworth","c":"Oscar Krug","p":"/embweEOzbEdv3FgNikIgv6ZoTS1.jpg","q":"Q1621558"},{"n":"Jane Novak","c":"Alice Morse","p":"/8EFBVUt1LZUjGP8yKcg8k92ZJ3x.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Wallace Beery","c":"Lt. Brandt","p":"/a26DU6lG8YPAr9QgSOCDuZWAI2l.jpg","q":"Q322179"},{"n":"James Gordon","c":"Bill Tavish","p":"/ngVF1uIAGqnZULYGu43OzRV6VfR.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Richard Wayne","c":"McQuestion","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"J.P. Lockney","c":"Matthew Morse","p":"/tEsT61IPEjS4E3ENHbxJG2xxcjm.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Gibson Gowland","c":"Gideon Blank","p":"/5peWO8JpDAgeb5NPGoOWvkpiyhX.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Otto Hoffman","c":"Mark Arnold","p":"/1C6VGYklEbMvKffXSNnGOhnv1VI.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Tom Ashton","c":"Fishing Boy","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Fred Kohler","c":"","p":"/lrJamRnwOSFxXUzEDbPiZvoRMxG.jpg","q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":[],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Behind_the_Door","qid":"Q3637479"}